  "term": "flourishing",
  "definition": "Flourishing is a multidimensional state of psychological well-being marked by active positive functioning, not just the absence of mental health problems. It involves strengths across emotional, cognitive, social, and existential aspects of life and can develop in different ways across the lifespan.",
